Twinsters is a family, documentary film directed by Samantha Futerman.

3
00:22:30,000 --> 00:22:36,000
Adopted from South Korea, raised on different continents &amp; connected through social media,
Samantha &amp; Anaïs believe that they are twin sisters separated at birth.

4
