7
00:52:30,000 --> 00:52:36,000
Twinsters is a 2015 documentary film which covers the true-life story of identical twin sisters, separated at birth, discovering each
other on-line, meeting, confirming their identity with a DNA test, and exploring aspects of their background together.

8
01:00:00,000 --> 01:00:06,000
The film was released as a biography genre documentary on
March 15, 2015, at South by Southwest.

9
01:07:30,000 --> 01:07:36,000
After that, the film was made available through various streaming
platforms, including Netflix, iTunes and Freeform.

10
01:15:00,000 --> 01:15:06,000
In September 2016, the network ABC bought a comedy based on the Twinsters
documentary from the creators responsible for Funny or Die.

11
01:22:30,000 --> 01:22:36,000
The film explores themes of twin sister, adoption, woman
director, sisterhood, international adoption.
